@17700 = ~Sarevok's Servant

Korlasz and her followers are defeated. I should report our success to Grand Duke Liia Jannath in the Ducal Palace.~
@17701 = ~Korlasz is dead. We stopped the escape from the palace prison.~
@17702 = ~Thank you, <CHARNAME>. The Flaming Fist will secure the prison and see to the survivors. You and your companions have earned the city's gratitude.~
@17703 = ~Then I shall take my leave.~
@17704 = ~Sarevok's Servant

I reported Korlasz's defeat to Grand Duke Liia Jannath. The Flaming Fist will secure the prison, and Liia has acknowledged our service to the city.~
